[BeginCRK]-----------------------------------
Patch to not give the new player 1000 gold.

Original, at address 004fdf7c (offset 000fd37c in the binary file):
    Binary: c7  41  3c  e8  03  00  00
    
    Assembly: DWORD PTR [ecx+0x3c], 1000

    Equivalent code: player->money = 1000;

New:
    Binary: c7  41  3c  00  00  00  00
            ==  ==  ==  ^^  ^^  ==  ==
    
    Assembly: DWORD PTR [ecx+0x3c], 0

    Equivalent code: player->money = 0;

Note: register ECX contains the pointer to the current player, 0x3c is the
offset to the `money` field. We change only the right-hand side of the
assignment operator, but check the whole instruction to make sure that we're
changing the right thing.

a2server.exe
000FD37C: C7 C7
000FD37D: 41 41
000FD37E: 3C 3C
000FD37F: E8 00
000FD380: 03 00
000FD381: 00 00
000FD382: 00 00

[EndCRK]-------------------------------------
[EndXCK]-------------------------------------
